From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: Windows.UI.Composition DropShadow, CompositionNineGridBrush, CompositionBackdropBrush

ICompositor2::CreateDropShadow, CreateNineGridBrush and CreateBackdropBrush were E_NOTIMPL. DropShadow (IDropShadow/IDropShadow2/ICompositionShadow) keeps BlurRadius, Color, Mask, Offset, Opacity, SourcePolicy (animatable; not drawn yet); sprite visuals gain ISpriteVisual2 (Shadow). The nine-grid brush draws its colour or surface source as nine parts (corners kept, edges stretched, centre stretched or hollow); the backdrop brush draws nothing, so what is behind shows. Interface identity per windows-rs 0.30 (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
---
--- a/dlls/dcomp/composition.c
